# 📅 Vibenex — Tiến Độ Phát Triển (27 Ngày)

> Bắt đầu: **08/05/2026** → Dự kiến hoàn thành: **03/06/2026**
> Mỗi ngày chia 2 phần: **Backend (BE)** buổi sáng → **Frontend (FE)** buổi chiều

---

## Phase 1: Project Setup & Foundation (Day 1–2)

### 📆 Day 1 — Project Init + Backend Foundation
- [ ] **BE**: `nest new vibenex-backend`, cấu hình TypeScript, ESLint
- [ ] **BE**: Docker Compose (PostgreSQL 16), `.env` config
- [ ] **BE**: Prisma init, tạo toàn bộ schema (User, Post, Comment, Like, Story, Follow, Conversation, Message, Notification)
- [ ] **BE**: `prisma migrate dev` + `prisma generate`
- [ ] **BE**: PrismaService module
- [ ] **FE**: `flutter create vibenex` tại `c:\Mobile\Social_media`
- [ ] **FE**: Setup `pubspec.yaml` (tất cả dependencies)
- [ ] **FE**: Tạo folder structure (core/, features/, l10n/)

### 📆 Day 2 — Core Infrastructure
- [ ] **FE**: `DioClient` (clone từ E-commerce, đổi baseUrl)
- [ ] **FE**: `GetIt` + `Injectable` DI setup
- [ ] **FE**: `AppConstants` (baseUrl, tokenKeys)
- [ ] **FE**: `AppTheme` (light + dark) + `ThemeNotifier`
- [ ] **FE**: `LocaleProvider` + ARB files (vi/en) với các key cơ bản
- [ ] **FE**: `GoRouter` skeleton + `AuthNotifier`
- [ ] **FE**: `ErrorMapper` utility
- [ ] **FE**: Shared widgets: `CustomButton`, `CustomTextField`, `AvatarWidget`, `LoadingOverlay`, `ShimmerLoading`
- [ ] **FE**: `l10n.yaml` config + `flutter gen-l10n`

> **✅ Milestone 1**: Project chạy được, hiển thị blank app với theme + routing

---

## Phase 2: Authentication (Day 3–4)

### 📆 Day 3 — Auth Backend + Models
- [ ] **BE**: Auth module — `register` endpoint (hash password bcrypt)
- [ ] **BE**: Auth module — `login` endpoint (JWT access + refresh token)
- [ ] **BE**: Auth module — `refresh` endpoint
- [ ] **BE**: Auth module — `forgot-password` endpoint (mock)
- [ ] **BE**: JWT strategy, AuthGuard, `@CurrentUser()` decorator
- [ ] **BE**: Swagger setup + test tất cả auth endpoints
- [ ] **FE**: Auth domain layer — `AuthRepository` (abstract), models (Freezed: `LoginRequest`, `RegisterRequest`, `AuthResponse`)
- [ ] **FE**: Auth data layer — Retrofit API service, Repository impl

### 📆 Day 4 — Auth UI + Flow
- [ ] **FE**: Auth UseCases: `LoginUseCase`, `RegisterUseCase`, `LogoutUseCase`, `CheckAuthUseCase`
- [ ] **FE**: `AuthBloc` + Events + States
- [ ] **FE**: `SplashPage` (Lottie animation + auto-login check)
- [ ] **FE**: `OnboardingPage` (3 slides + SharedPreferences flag)
- [ ] **FE**: `LoginPage` (form + validation + error display)
- [ ] **FE**: `RegisterPage` (form + username unique check)
- [ ] **FE**: `ForgotPasswordPage`
- [ ] **FE**: GoRouter redirect logic (auth guard)
- [ ] **FE**: Wire up `main.dart` (MultiBlocProvider + AuthBloc)
- [ ] **Test**: Register → Login → Auto-login → Logout flow

> **✅ Milestone 2**: User có thể register, login, auto-login, logout hoàn chỉnh

---

## Phase 3: User Profile (Day 5–7)

### 📆 Day 5 — Profile Backend
- [ ] **BE**: Users module — `GET /users/me` (current user profile)
- [ ] **BE**: Users module — `GET /users/:id` (other user profile)
- [ ] **BE**: Users module — `PATCH /users/me` (update name, username, bio)
- [ ] **BE**: Upload module — Multer config (images → `uploads/` folder)
- [ ] **BE**: Users module — `POST /users/me/avatar` (upload + save URL)
- [ ] **BE**: Users module — `POST /users/me/cover` (upload + save URL)
- [ ] **BE**: Users module — `GET /users/search?q=` (ILIKE search)
- [ ] **BE**: Serve static files (`/uploads/...`)

### 📆 Day 6 — Profile Frontend (Domain + Data)
- [ ] **FE**: User domain — `UserModel` (Freezed), `UserRepository` (abstract)
- [ ] **FE**: User data — Retrofit API, Repository impl
- [ ] **FE**: UseCases: `GetMyProfile`, `GetUserProfile`, `UpdateProfile`, `UploadAvatar`, `UploadCover`
- [ ] **FE**: `UserBloc` / `ProfileBloc` + Events + States

### 📆 Day 7 — Profile UI
- [ ] **FE**: `ProfilePage` — cover + avatar + stats + bio + post grid placeholder
- [ ] **FE**: `EditProfilePage` — form + image picker + upload
- [ ] **FE**: `UserTile` widget (avatar + name + username + action button)
- [ ] **FE**: Avatar tap → Bottom sheet (Camera/Gallery/Remove)
- [ ] **FE**: Image compression utility
- [ ] **FE**: Hook vào Router + Bottom Nav
- [ ] **Test**: View profile → Edit → Upload avatar/cover → Verify

> **✅ Milestone 3**: Profile hoàn chỉnh (xem, sửa, upload ảnh)

