## Phase 4: Post & Feed System (Day 8–12) ⭐

### 📆 Day 8 — Post Backend
- [ ] **BE**: Posts module — `POST /posts` (multipart: content + images/video)
- [ ] **BE**: Posts module — `GET /posts` (paginated feed, include author info)
- [ ] **BE**: Posts module — `GET /posts/:id` (detail + author)
- [ ] **BE**: Posts module — `GET /posts/user/:userId` (user's posts)
- [ ] **BE**: Posts module — `DELETE /posts/:id` (owner only)
- [ ] **BE**: Image/video upload handling (multiple files)
- [ ] **BE**: Video thumbnail generation (hoặc client gửi thumbnail)

### 📆 Day 9 — Like + Comment Backend
- [ ] **BE**: `POST /posts/:id/like` — toggle like (create/delete + update count atomically)
- [ ] **BE**: `GET /posts/:id/like-status` — check if current user liked
- [ ] **BE**: Comments module — `GET /posts/:postId/comments` (paginated)
- [ ] **BE**: Comments module — `POST /posts/:postId/comments` (add + update count)
- [ ] **BE**: Comments module — `DELETE /comments/:id` (owner only + update count)

### 📆 Day 10 — Feed Frontend (Domain + Data + BLoC)
- [ ] **FE**: Post domain — `PostModel`, `CommentModel` (Freezed)
- [ ] **FE**: Post data — Retrofit API, `PostRepository`, `CommentRepository`
- [ ] **FE**: UseCases: `GetFeed`, `CreatePost`, `DeletePost`, `ToggleLike`, `GetComments`, `AddComment`
- [ ] **FE**: `FeedBloc` (LoadFeed, LoadMore, Refresh) + States (loading, loaded, error, hasMore)
- [ ] **FE**: `PostBloc` (CreatePost, DeletePost, ToggleLike)
- [ ] **FE**: `CommentBloc` (LoadComments, AddComment, DeleteComment)

### 📆 Day 11 — Feed UI
- [ ] **FE**: `PostCard` widget (author header, content, media, action bar)
- [ ] **FE**: `ImageGrid` widget (1/2/3/4 image layouts)
- [ ] **FE**: `VideoPlayerWidget` (inline player, autoplay on scroll)
- [ ] **FE**: `FeedScreen` (ListView + PostCard + pull-to-refresh + infinite scroll)
- [ ] **FE**: Double-tap like animation (heart scale + particles)
- [ ] **FE**: Shimmer loading skeleton cho feed

### 📆 Day 12 — Create Post + Post Detail
- [ ] **FE**: `CreatePostScreen` (text input + media picker + preview + upload progress)
- [ ] **FE**: `PostDetailScreen` (full post + comment list + comment input)
- [ ] **FE**: `CommentTile` widget
- [ ] **FE**: Post menu (⋯) — Delete (own) / Report
- [ ] **FE**: Full-screen image viewer (PhotoView + swipe)
- [ ] **Test**: Create post (text/image/video) → Feed → Like → Comment → Delete

> **✅ Milestone 4**: Feed hoàn chỉnh — tạo, xem, like, comment, xoá post

