## Phase 4.5: Story System (Day 13–15)

### 📆 Day 13 — Story Backend
- [ ] **BE**: Stories module — `POST /stories` (multipart: image/video + caption)
- [ ] **BE**: Stories module — `GET /stories` (active only: `expiresAt > NOW()`, group by author)
- [ ] **BE**: Stories module — `POST /stories/:id/view` (mark viewed, increment viewCount)
- [ ] **BE**: Stories module — `DELETE /stories/:id` (owner only)
- [ ] **BE**: Stories module — `GET /stories/me` (my stories + view list)

### 📆 Day 14 — Story Frontend (BLoC + Data)
- [ ] **FE**: Story domain — `StoryModel` (Freezed), `StoryRepository`
- [ ] **FE**: Story data — Retrofit API, Repository impl
- [ ] **FE**: `StoryBloc` (LoadStories, CreateStory, ViewStory, DeleteStory)
- [ ] **FE**: `CreateStoryScreen` (camera/gallery → preview → caption → post)

### 📆 Day 15 — Story UI
- [ ] **FE**: `StoryCircle` widget (avatar + gradient ring animated)
- [ ] **FE**: Story bar (horizontal scroll list, tích hợp vào FeedScreen)
- [ ] **FE**: `StoryViewerScreen` (full-screen, progress bars, tap/swipe navigation)
- [ ] **FE**: `StoryProgressBar` widget (segmented animated bar)
- [ ] **FE**: Auto-advance timer (5s image, video duration)
- [ ] **Test**: Create story → View → Progress → Auto-advance → Swipe users

> **✅ Milestone 5**: Story system hoạt động — tạo, xem, auto-expire

