## Phase 6: Real-time Chat (Day 19–22)

### 📆 Day 19 — Chat Backend (REST)
- [ ] **BE**: Chat module — `POST /conversations/:userId` (get or create)
- [ ] **BE**: Chat module — `GET /conversations` (my conversations, sort by lastMessageAt)
- [ ] **BE**: Chat module — `GET /conversations/:id/messages` (paginated)
- [ ] **BE**: Chat module — `POST /conversations/:id/messages` (send, fallback REST)
- [ ] **BE**: Chat module — `PATCH /conversations/:id/read` (mark all as read)

### 📆 Day 20 — Chat Backend (WebSocket)
- [ ] **BE**: Install `@nestjs/websockets` + `socket.io`
- [ ] **BE**: `ChatGateway` — WebSocket gateway with JWT auth
- [ ] **BE**: Events: `joinRoom`, `sendMessage`, `typing`, `leaveRoom`
- [ ] **BE**: Broadcast: `newMessage`, `userTyping`
- [ ] **BE**: Test WebSocket với Postman/wscat

### 📆 Day 21 — Chat Frontend (BLoC + Data)
- [ ] **FE**: Add `socket_io_client` dependency
- [ ] **FE**: Chat domain — `ConversationModel`, `MessageModel` (Freezed)
- [ ] **FE**: Chat data — Retrofit API (REST) + SocketService (realtime)
- [ ] **FE**: `ChatRepository` impl
- [ ] **FE**: `ChatBloc` (LoadRooms, OpenRoom, SendMessage, ReceiveMessage, Typing)

### 📆 Day 22 — Chat UI
- [ ] **FE**: `ChatListPage` (conversation list + unread badge + last message preview)
- [ ] **FE**: `ChatRoomPage` (message bubbles + input bar + image send)
- [ ] **FE**: `ChatBubble` widget (sent/received styles + time + read status)
- [ ] **FE**: Typing indicator ("đang nhập...")
- [ ] **FE**: Unread badge trên Bottom Nav (Chat tab)
- [ ] **FE**: Auto-scroll to bottom khi có tin nhắn mới
- [ ] **FE**: Tích hợp "Message" button trên other user's profile
- [ ] **Test**: Open chat → Send text → Receive realtime → Send image → Typing indicator

> **✅ Milestone 7**: Chat realtime hoạt động hoàn chỉnh

