## Phase 7: Notifications & Polish (Day 23–27)

### 📆 Day 23 — Notification Backend
- [ ] **BE**: Notification module — `GET /notifications` (paginated, my notifications)
- [ ] **BE**: Notification module — `PATCH /notifications/:id/read`
- [ ] **BE**: Notification module — `PATCH /notifications/read-all`
- [ ] **BE**: Tích hợp tạo notification khi: Like, Comment, Follow
