### 📆 Day 24 — Notification Frontend
- [ ] **FE**: Notification domain — `NotificationModel` (Freezed), Repository
- [ ] **FE**: `NotificationBloc` (Load, MarkRead, MarkAllRead)
- [ ] **FE**: `NotificationsPage` (list + unread highlight + tap navigation)
- [ ] **FE**: `NotificationTile` widget (icon by type + content + time)
