### 📆 Day 25 — Settings + Extras
- [ ] **FE**: `SettingsPage` (theme toggle, language switch, logout, delete account)
- [ ] **BE**: `DELETE /users/me` (delete account + cascade)
- [ ] **BE**: `PATCH /auth/change-password` (old + new password)
- [ ] **FE**: `ChangePasswordPage`
- [ ] **FE**: Onboarding hoàn thiện (illustrations + animations)

### 📆 Day 26 — UI Polish
- [ ] **FE**: Shimmer loading cho tất cả list screens
- [ ] **FE**: Empty state widgets (illustrations + messages)
- [ ] **FE**: Error state widgets (retry buttons)
- [ ] **FE**: Page transition animations (slide, fade)
- [ ] **FE**: Hero animations (avatar list → profile)
- [ ] **FE**: Haptic feedback (like, follow, send message)
- [ ] **FE**: Offline banner (connectivity_plus)
