### 📆 Day 27 — Testing & Final Polish
- [ ] **Full flow test**: Register → Login → Create post → Like → Comment → Follow → Chat → Notification
- [ ] **i18n review**: Kiểm tra tất cả strings Vi/En
- [ ] **Dark mode review**: Kiểm tra tất cả screens trong dark mode
- [ ] **Edge cases**: Long text, no network, empty states, rapid taps
- [ ] **Performance**: Lazy loading, image caching, dispose controllers
- [ ] **Code cleanup**: Remove debug prints, unused imports
- [ ] **README.md**: Setup instructions, architecture overview

> **✅ Milestone 8 (FINAL)**: Vibenex hoàn chỉnh, sẵn sàng demo 🎉

